## Names that are not in snake_case

```catala
declaration structure Person:
  data birthDate content date
  data section_121_b_2_A content boolean

declaration scope Sub:
  output x content integer

declaration scope A:
  input p content Person
  output totalValue content integer
    state art93quaterI
    state finalAmount
  output f content integer depends on inputValue content integer
  output montantÉlevé content integer
  subScope scope Sub
  output x2Yz content integer
  output a_Bc content integer
  output holdsURL content boolean

declaration addOne content integer
  depends on someArg content integer
  equals
  let localVar equals someArg in
  localVar + 1

scope Sub:
  definition x equals 1

scope A:
  definition totalValue state art93quaterI equals addOne of 0
  definition totalValue state finalAmount equals totalValue + subScope.x
  definition f of inputValue equals inputValue
  definition montantÉlevé equals 0
  definition x2Yz equals 0
  definition a_Bc equals if p.section_121_b_2_A then 1 else 0
  definition holdsURL equals p.birthDate > |2000-01-01|
```

